      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the reference to AccessDeviceService is optional, then you should not make the olt app a requirement in pom.xml. Using optional references gives you the benefit of installing and activating apps in any given order, but by specifying the app requirement in pom.xml you require the olt app to be installed first, which does not justify the complexity of maintaining an optional reference here.",
